* 913_integer_pred.sno — INTEGER predicate
* Rung 9. 3 assertions.

*       non-numeric string fails
        INTEGER('abc')             :f(e001)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 913/001: integer(string) should fail' :(END)
e001

*       integer value succeeds
        INTEGER(12)                :s(e002)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 913/002: integer(12) should succeed'  :(END)
e002

*       numeric string succeeds (string '12' is an integer)
        INTEGER('12')              :s(e003)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 913/003: integer(numeric-string) should succeed' :(END)
e003

        OUTPUT = 'PASS 913_integer_pred (3/3)'
END
